<title>USA: Grants/Cibola Cty SD, N.M. won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Grants/Cibola Cty SD, N.M. won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said it won $1 million of Grants/Cibola Sch Dist No. 1, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.1487 percent.</p>
